flowchart TB
    M[Current matter identity wall and processing authority]
    V[LogicalDocument and immutable SourceVersion]
    V --> C[Custody party checklist and review records]
    V --> L[LegalFindingRevision and exact evidence]
    V --> F[FinancialFact and decisions]
    F --> FC[Applied 0038 internal context evidence decisions and staging]
    V --> DP[DisclosurePlan review artifact validation decisions]
    L --> DR[DDRRun evidence attempts artifacts task and decision]
    DR --> RP[DDRReportLink and ReportVersion]
    RP --> RA[ReleasePackage and independent release approvals]
    DP --> RA
    RA --> PR[Audience-specific projection with current reauthorization]

    C --> U[All contributing retained source scopes]
    L --> U
    F --> U
    FC --> U
    DP --> U
    DR --> U
    M --> K{Current authority AND every required retained restriction}
    U --> K
    K -. internal work access .-> C
    K -. internal work access .-> FC
    K -. internal work access .-> DR
    M -. explicit derivative authorization without original disclosure .-> PR

    C --> S[Signing manifest hashes and scoped retained audit]
    F --> S
    FC --> S
    DP --> S
    DR --> S
    RA --> S
    S --> H[Hold retention and controlled eligible client-copy disposal]

